# Licence

This repository contains two types of content with different licences.

## Text, images, diagrams, documentation — Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0)

All Markdown pages (`.md`), images (`.svg`, `.png`), diagrams, and documentation in this repository are licensed under CC BY-SA 4.0.

You are free to:
- **Share** — copy and redistribute the material in any medium or format
- **Adapt** — remix, transform, and build upon the material for any purpose, even commercially

Under the following terms:
- **Attribution** — You must give appropriate credit, provide a link to the licence, and indicate if changes were made
- **ShareAlike** — If you remix, transform, or build upon the material, you must distribute your contributions under the same licence as the original

Full licence text: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/legalcode

---

