## Summary

| Content | Licence |
|---------|---------|
| Markdown pages, images, diagrams, documentation | CC BY-SA 4.0 |
| C source code (`main.c`) | MIT |

This dual-licence approach lets people freely use the code in their own projects (MIT) while ensuring the course materials stay open and attributed (CC BY-SA 4.0).